# An allowlist: the build context holds only what the image installs and runs. Everything else
# stays out, .env with its keys first of all, and also the tests, the web app and infra/.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!server/mockingbird
!server/data
!server/migrations
!scripts/entrypoint.sh

# Bytecode from local runs. The image compiles its own.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
